From 5f6e87ab3113ee0064299fb6b15884031992e21a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Sun, 20 Sep 2026 23:50:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 19/19] fix: unblock Google login and Health reads on iOS

Google no longer dies when the iOS client ID is empty: it falls back
to the existing Web client via com.narutoaii.ayg://login-callback.
Health now configures the plugin, requests read-only access, and
keeps partial data instead of swallowing every error.

